This repository is a JAX port of the SGHMC experiment code (ML-SGHMC),
    https://github.com/tqchen/ML-SGHMC
by Tianqi Chen, Emily Fox and Carlos Guestrin, which accompanies

    Chen, Fox and Guestrin. "Stochastic Gradient Hamiltonian Monte Carlo."
    ICML 2014, PMLR 32(2):1683-1691.

The method, the experimental design and the original code are theirs; this
repository ports them and does not introduce them. The upstream commits
survive in this repository's git history. The original repository carries no
license of its own; this port is an independent reimplementation released
under the Apache License 2.0.

The port was written with the assistance of Claude Code (Anthropic).
If you use this software, please cite the paper above (see CITATION.cff).
